<title>MEXICO: Telmex updates number of shares.</title>
<headline>Telmex updates number of shares.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telefonos de Mexico (Telmex) on Thursday issued an updated accounting of its number of shares following the conversion of 3,843,920 A shares into L shares, the Mexican stock exchange reported.</p>
<p>Telmex, the most heavily weighted issue on the Mexican bourse, now has 5,995,413,857 L shares and 254,086,137 A shares, the statement said.</p>
<p>The new figures also reflect the buyback of 35,662,000 L shares in May, the statement said.</p>
<p>((-- Karina Balderas, Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9562))</p>
